[[Image:ChefT.png|left]]''<font style="font-size:15px">{{Quote|Are you the next top Chef in [[Free Realms|Free Realms™]]? Master the culinary arts, and hone your skills in challenging mini-games. Harvest ingredients, and combine them to create interesting recipes and tasty delights. Food can be given or sold to other players to provide bonuses and helpful effects. Simone in the [[Cobblestone Village|Crossroads]] is an excellent Chef and can teach anyone interested in the culinary arts.|Job description}}</font>''
'''Chef''' is a crafting [[Jobs|job]], specializing in the creation of food that can temporarily increase a player's stats. A crafting class job, experience is gained by completing Chef quests and by playing the harvesting and cooking [[Mini-Games|minigames]].   

==Restrictions - This job is locked for MEMBERS ONLY==
[[File:Members only.png|left]]
: As of December 5th 2009, this job is free to sample through level 4. You will be able to change into this job, but you will not be able to use it until you purchase a Free Realms [[Membership]].

==Unlocking Chef==
Chef can be unlocked by activating a quest line with any of the following trainers:
* [[Cookie]] in the [[Sacred Glade]] tutorial (no longer in-game)
* [[Simone]] in [[Cobblestone Village]]
* [[Auguste Frydaze]] in [[Highroad Junction]]
* [[Bordon Cloo]] in [[Sanctuary]]
* [[Helena]] in [[Stillwater Crossing]]

